  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0 - JSON Serialization Abstraction\n• BREAKING: IpcNode now requires IJsonSerializer in constructor\n• Abstracted JSON serialization via IJsonSerializer interface\n• No longer depends on System.Text.Json directly\n• Choose between System.Text.Json or JSON.NET (Newtonsoft.Json)\n• Install IpcLibrary.Serialization.SystemTextJson or IpcLibrary.Serialization.Newtonsoft\n• Full backward compatibility for functionality (API changed)\n\nv1.0.1 - Documentation Update\n• Enhanced README with NuGet installation instructions\n• Added 5-minute tutorial for quick start\n\nv1.0.0 - Initial Release\n• Peer-to-peer mesh networking with auto-discovery\n• 100% test coverage (176/176 tests passing)",
